The issue likely is that the JSON string must be a proper JSON value, not include extra quotes at end. The format should be:

{
  "route": "{\"type\":\"mol\",...}"
}

So action_input should be that dict. Ensure no extra quotes after closing brace. Let's construct:

{
  "route": "{\"type\":\"mol\",\"smiles\":\"[CH2:1]=[C:2]([c:3]1[cH:4][cH:5][cH:6][cH:7][cH:8]1)[C@@H:9]1[CH2:10][CH2:11][CH2:12][C@@:13]1([OH:14])[C:15]([F:16])([F:17])[F:18]\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"reaction\",\"template_id\":\"1209837\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"mol\",\"smiles\":\"C=C(C)C(=O)O[C@@]1(C(F)(F)F)CCC[C@H]1C(=C)c1ccccc1\"}]}]}"
}

Now send.
